{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're in charge of a Tabletop Game Shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the owner, every aspect of the store is in your hands. Set prices, design the layout, and create the perfect atmosphere to attract new customers. Hire and train employees to handle the cash register, restock shelves, or even paint and assemble miniatures.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/de5558798780faf1d9beb7511ee2744b.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/de5558798780faf1d9beb7511ee2744b.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/de5558798780faf1d9beb7511ee2744b.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your Stock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock your shelves with everything a tabletop gamer could want! Order miniatures, rulebooks, paints, and gaming accessories to keep your customers coming back for more. Choose whether to sell pre-assembled figurines or let customers hunt for rare parts in collectible mystery packs. Adapt your stock to customer demands and market trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/295f34a8131a458bb4d10c334e8f9fc8.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/295f34a8131a458bb4d10c334e8f9fc8.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/295f34a8131a458bb4d10c334e8f9fc8.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect, Assemble &amp; Paint Miniature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not just a store owner, you\u2019re also a collector! Open mystery packs to discover rare miniature parts, then assemble and paint them to increase their value. Sell them for profit or keep them for your personal collection. Create stunning, one-of-a-kind figures that will impress your customers and boost your shop\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/e68b1e0137d8b79031a46b0c40f297a7.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/e68b1e0137d8b79031a46b0c40f297a7.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/e68b1e0137d8b79031a46b0c40f297a7.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Against Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your shop isn\u2019t just for selling, it\u2019s a place where players gather to test their armies! Organize tournaments and one-on-one battles against customers to prove your skills. Use your best miniatures and strategies to dominate the battlefield, earning rewards and boosting your shop\u2019s prestige. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/005301294594e5c7388c103c7da7a34d.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/005301294594e5c7388c103c7da7a34d.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/005301294594e5c7388c103c7da7a34d.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your shop to hold bigger events, add more product licences, and attract high-profile customers. Host special game nights, launch exclusive figure collections, and turn your store into the heart of the tabletop gaming community. The more successful you are, the bigger the opportunities! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/924fa9430cb27643235ff6dd3cbe8f02.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/924fa9430cb27643235ff6dd3cbe8f02.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/924fa9430cb27643235ff6dd3cbe8f02.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to roll the dice and build your dream store in Tabletop Game Shop Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524750?t=1753171687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/0a30b72f3916947f3ed135954539abeffdd5675a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753171687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/6a5ba53c9613f63903834fc9ee16923429f59064/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753171687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/6a5ba53c9613f63903834fc9ee16923429f59064/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753171687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're in charge of a Tabletop Game Shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the owner, every aspect of the store is in your hands. Set prices, design the layout, and create the perfect atmosphere to attract new customers. Hire and train employees to handle the cash register, restock shelves, or even paint and assemble miniatures.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/de5558798780faf1d9beb7511ee2744b.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/de5558798780faf1d9beb7511ee2744b.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/de5558798780faf1d9beb7511ee2744b.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your Stock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock your shelves with everything a tabletop gamer could want! Order miniatures, rulebooks, paints, and gaming accessories to keep your customers coming back for more. Choose whether to sell pre-assembled figurines or let customers hunt for rare parts in collectible mystery packs. Adapt your stock to customer demands and market trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pla