ige. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/005301294594e5c7388c103c7da7a34d.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/005301294594e5c7388c103c7da7a34d.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/005301294594e5c7388c103c7da7a34d.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand Your Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your shop to hold bigger events, add more product licences, and attract high-profile customers. Host special game nights, launch exclusive figure collections, and turn your store into the heart of the tabletop gaming community. The more successful you are, the bigger the opportunities! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/924fa9430cb27643235ff6dd3cbe8f02.poster.avif?t=1753171687\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/924fa9430cb27643235ff6dd3cbe8f02.webm?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/extras/924fa9430cb27643235ff6dd3cbe8f02.mp4?t=1753171687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to roll the dice and build your dream store in Tabletop Game Shop Simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ludogram","Knight Fever Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524750/43c482ecfb1c9bf3d10beab6c3ce0f9e538438